  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Flexible fund for regional/national/sub-national adaptation/mitigation/resilience including evidence for research.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Component 2 will be focused on climate outcomes through adaptation, resilience and mitigation measures which support the most vulnerable. Component 2 will support demand-led, flexible TA bilaterally focussed on adaptation, resilience, and mitigation outcomes (with a focus on the most climate vulnerable communities) which can be flexed to scale across the Central Asia countries. TA will also contribute towards evidence and research for better quality of scientific data and information. This component will support individual countries in Central Asia to deliver their NDC targets by improving sector specific capacity, improving enabling policies and regulations for transition.</narrative>
  </description>
